00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:27.434
thong thong, thong, thongs
to the White House.

00:06:27.434 --> 00:06:30.100
Welcome, Girls5eva.

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:32.100
How you feeling today, ladies?
-Blessed.

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:33.667
-Great.
-Amazing.

00:06:33.667 --> 00:06:35.267
-God-like.
[ Laughter ]

00:06:35.267 --> 00:06:37.968
-God-like.
-Okay.

00:06:37.968 --> 00:06:42.000
Now, I hear you are about
to go back into the studio

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:45.868
to record your first album
since "2K01."

00:06:45.868 --> 00:06:48.167
Now, is that accurate?
-Absolutely, Nathan.

00:06:48.167 --> 00:06:50.167
We start next week,
and we're just super excited --

00:06:50.167 --> 00:06:51.567
-I love New York.

00:06:51.567 --> 00:06:55.267
I like to eat burgers
and look at the skyline.

00:06:55.267 --> 00:06:58.200
-Yes, and we're hungry
to get back at it.

00:06:58.200 --> 00:06:59.734
Right, ladies?
-Absolutely.

00:06:59.734 --> 00:07:02.367
-Yum, Yum, jum jum.
[ Laughter ]

00:07:02.367 --> 00:07:03.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:04.834
-Paula Pell, everybody!

00:07:04.834 --> 00:07:08.968
The new season of "Girls5eva"
premiers May 5th on Peacock.

